# Digsite Conservator: "When this creature dies, you may pay {4}. If you do, discover 4" triggers on any death (CR 700.4), not
# only when it is sacrificed. Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 2, when Bot1 has Moxes Pearl, Ruby and Sapphire untapped:
# three mana is not {4} (the payment is refused), so Bot1 declines and nothing is discovered: the Anaconda stays in the library.

